---
title: Table
description: A simple table component for displaying tabular data.
---

<ComponentPreview name="p-table-1" />

## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/table.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import { Table } from "@coss-sv/ui";
</script>

<Table.Root>
  <Table.Caption>Caption</Table.Caption>
  <Table.Header><Table.Row><Table.Head>Header</Table.Head></Table.Row></Table.Header>
  <Table.Body><Table.Row><Table.Cell>Cell</Table.Cell></Table.Row></Table.Body>
</Table.Root>
```

## API Reference

### Table.Root

The table container. Set `variant="card"` for separated borders, rounded corners, and card row surfaces.

| Prop      | Type                  | Default     |
| --------- | --------------------- | ----------- |
| `class`   | `string`              |             |
| `variant` | `"default" \| "card"` | `"default"` |

### Table.Header

Header section containing column headers.

### Table.Body

Body section containing table rows and cells.

### Table.Footer

Footer section for totals and summary rows.

### Table.Row

A table row.

### Table.Head

A column header cell.

### Table.Cell

A data cell.

### Table.Caption

A caption for the table.

